# Computational Evidence Recovery Status

## Study
Patient-Specific Cardiac Digital Twin Under Altered Gravity

## Evidence-recovery status
The computational evidence archive was reviewed according to the predefined
Stage-3 recovery priorities.

### Priority 1 — Native COMSOL model
Status: NOT RECOVERED

The native COMSOL `.mph` master model was not included in the public repository.
The repository therefore does not claim complete native-model reproducibility.

### Priority 2 — Geometry and meshes
Status: PARTIALLY DOCUMENTED

Patient-specific geometry reconstruction, mesh generation, mesh-quality
assessment, and execution records are retained as derived documentation.
Underlying source imaging remains at the originating dataset.

### Priority 3 — Patient × gravity raw outputs
Status: PARTIALLY RECOVERED / SOURCE VERIFICATION REQUIRED

Structured gravity-result records are retained where available. Numerical
values are not treated as definitive manuscript Results unless traceable to
an executed computational export.

### Priority 4 — Solver and numerical-verification records
Status: PARTIALLY DOCUMENTED

The repository contains solver configuration and convergence documentation.
Complete native COMSOL solver logs are not claimed unless directly recovered
from the executed model environment.

### Priority 5 — Sensitivity-analysis outputs
Status: PARTIALLY DOCUMENTED

Sensitivity-analysis design and parameter definitions are retained.
Numerical sensitivity values require traceability to executed model outputs
before being reported as definitive Results.

### Priority 6 — Spatial FEM fields
Status: PARTIALLY RECOVERED

Structured spatial field-export formats are documented. Complete patient-level
field archives are not claimed unless directly recovered from the executed
COMSOL model.

### Priority 7 — Execution environment
Status: DOCUMENTED

The computational environment, COMSOL version, solver configuration and
available hardware are recorded in the computational provenance documentation.

### Priority 8 — SHA-256 checksums
Status: PENDING

Cryptographic checksums will only be reported after being generated directly
from the final repository files. Placeholder or illustrative hashes are not
used as evidence.

### Priority 9 — Final execution manifest
Status: PARTIALLY COMPLETED

A centralized provenance and reconciliation structure has been established.
Final manifest closure remains dependent on recovery/verification of the
underlying computational artifacts.

## Manuscript policy

Only verified or directly traceable computational results are reported as
quantitative manuscript findings. Documentation, candidate outputs and
unverified numerical examples are not represented as measured experimental
results.

## Source-data policy

Original source imaging datasets and restricted source files are not
redistributed through this repository. The repository contains only
de-identified study records, methodological documentation and study-derived
computational artifacts permitted for dissemination.
